#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-voting.rst:5
#: dc8084656f23455580c4220680d32b03
msgid "Voting"
msgstr "投票"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-voting.rst:7
#: f7c64997fb6147f6acbf7ad4dc5528db
msgid ""
"The development team votes on various proposals including the \"Top "
"Contribution of the Month\".  This page shows how these votes should be "
"conducted."
msgstr "开发团队对各种提案进行投票，包括「月度最佳贡献」。本页介绍这些投票的操作方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-voting.rst:10
#: d683c04c5a314fdc844f70de6e1557e4
msgid "Creating a voting form"
msgstr "创建投票表单"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-voting.rst:12
#: 9d675e8049ce4a9e832bb803d21adf55
msgid ""
"Description below how to create a form from scratch, alternatively you can "
"use `this template "
"<https://docs.google.com/forms/d/12blIQLXUpibOFeCqWrWsHHroRJbgh7PXUfVQHfN_1tY/copy>`__."
msgstr ""
"下文介绍如何从头创建表单，您也可以使用 `此模板 "
"<https://docs.google.com/forms/d/12blIQLXUpibOFeCqWrWsHHroRJbgh7PXUfVQHfN_1tY/copy>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-voting.rst:17
#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-voting.rst:51
#: 73beb517e51e4a41a46edf1cc8d1f199 8d38a70c45114598b4ed8a1a14cd67dc
msgid "open `docs.google.com/forms <https://docs.google.com/forms>`__"
msgstr "打开 `docs.google.com/forms <https://docs.google.com/forms>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-voting.rst:18
#: 0a63531ed37c4e61bd88036f58ce9b5b
msgid "under \"Start a new form\" select \"+\" (or Blank)"
msgstr "在「新建表单」下选择「+」（或空白）"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-voting.rst:23
#: d191dc6bf022432dbaa7e0afa670c2e7
msgid ""
"fill in the form title both in the main view and on the top left of the page"
msgstr "在主视图和页面左上角分别填写表单标题"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-voting.rst:24
#: 94a1e5e11dcd444498d1be3f6d1380ac
msgid "In the description we normally add the following line:"
msgstr "在描述中，通常添加以下行："

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-voting.rst:26
#: 5b001ee3e155436baaf4741322783f54
msgid ""
"\"As this is a non-technical proposal, no reason/s are required, just pick "
"one.  For more details on how this works see here: "
"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Pj2ffFvwTnN2HxeTeBXyV7oAq0YONE98E6EJVVpDXCA/edit?usp=sharing\""
msgstr ""
"「由于这是非技术性提案，无需说明理由，直接选择即可。有关操作方式的更多详情，请参见：https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Pj2ffFvwTnN2HxeTeBXyV7oAq0YONE98E6EJVVpDXCA/edit?usp=sharing」"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-voting.rst:28
#: 21382c1594bb4439a2cddd6d70217e6e
msgid ""
"The first question should be titled \"Your Email\", of type \"Short answer\""
" and \"Required\""
msgstr "第一个问题应命名为「您的邮箱」，类型为「简答题」且设为「必填」"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-voting.rst:29
#: 68eab5fdd9154bd986b537a45646928a
msgid "The 2nd question is normally a \"Multiple choice\" and also \"Required\""
msgstr "第二个问题通常为「多选题」，同样设为「必填」"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-voting.rst:34
#: e4e2bb09d1a440e7b800847cba0a3a9b
msgid ""
"To allow users to modify their responses, select the gear icon and check "
"\"Edit after submit\" and press Save"
msgstr "若要允许用户修改回答，请点击齿轮图标，勾选「提交后可修改」，然后点击保存"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-voting.rst:39
#: 0fbb709f521447b0a96a08d46037e80b
msgid "Finally to send out the voting form:"
msgstr "最后，发送投票表单的步骤如下："

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-voting.rst:41
#: 9720d5e0df144481bbf8405251e61f74
msgid "push the Send button"
msgstr "点击「发送」按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-voting.rst:42
#: 74470d9ddbea42ee82511f9c618b8548
msgid "set the \"Email To\" field to \"ardupilot-dev-team@googlegroups.com\""
msgstr "将「收件人」字段设为「ardupilot-dev-team@googlegroups.com」"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-voting.rst:43
#: 271a51aba6c2499ca8519219e92d841b
msgid "fill in the Subject and Message fields"
msgstr "填写主题和消息字段"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-voting.rst:44
#: 6d3d4bd261c8421a80046fd558e39a86
msgid ""
"to allow others to see the responses (including ardupilot.devel@gmail.com), "
"click the \"Collaborators\" link and add their email in the \"Invite "
"people\" field"
msgstr "若要允许其他人查看回答（包括 ardupilot.devel@gmail.com），请点击「协作者」链接，在「邀请人员」字段中添加其邮箱"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-voting.rst:45
#: 16e503c6af254dc285e49a01e4df12f0
msgid "check \"Include form in email\" and press \"Send\""
msgstr "勾选「在邮件中包含表单」，然后点击「发送」"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-voting.rst:47
#: d16d934604444de0943a06de3ce19c7b
msgid ""
"Normally the vote should be open for 1 week and be discussed at the weekly "
"development call."
msgstr "通常投票应开放 1 周，并在每周开发例会上讨论。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-voting.rst:49
#: 85fb9ee702c34f01ac30cabaef0c4a56
msgid ""
"After the voting period ends, you will want to check the response and inform"
" the development team:"
msgstr "投票期结束后，您需要查看结果并通知开发团队："

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-voting.rst:52
#: 46ac82df5ab849c1841bc1e03fcf6150
msgid "find your voting form and click on it"
msgstr "找到您的投票表单并点击打开"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-voting.rst:53
#: f23e2b1a36e6493f874c633c4ed9593f
msgid ""
"click the \"Responses\" tab to see a graph of who voted (ensure there is "
"only one response per person) and the results."
msgstr "点击「回答」选项卡，查看投票者图表（确保每人只有一条回答）和结果。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-voting.rst:55
#: 7e6106cb06224e098f85a654f76ddc29
#, no-python-format
msgid "The vote is passed if more than 50% of the responses are positive."
msgstr "若超过 50% 的回答为支持，则投票通过。"
